nk\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (formal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}_{S,g}(R)\\)</span> (effective inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> (standard provability formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\)</span> (standardness and derivability conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" href=\"?note=b3bba05b63c0ebbf\" title=\"88-df-consistent\">88-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (fixed contradiction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\neq0\">\\(0\\neq0\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SecondInc}_{R,g,\\Pr}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{SecondInc}_{R,g,\\Pr}(T)\\)</span> (second-incompleteness property)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq(0\\neq0),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}})})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq(0\\neq0),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\bot_{\\mathrm{arith}})})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SecondInc}_{R,g,\\Pr}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Biggl(\n\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to T\\nvdash_R\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SecondInc}_{R,g,\\Pr}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Biggl(\n\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to T\\nvdash_R\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}\\)</span> : 在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>内部表达的标准一致性句</li>\n<li>结论区分了元语言条件<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_R(T)\\)</span>与对象语言中的一致性句</li>\n<li>固定矛盾句已定义为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\neq0\">\\(0\\neq0\\)</span>；不再让未声明的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>进入编码函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"b3bba05b63c0ebbf","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-consistent]]","embed